    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18087" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφαγν-ίζω</span></b> , fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιῶ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Le.</u>
					14.52
				</span></i>
			: aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ήγνισα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Paus.
					2.31.8
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Le.</u>
				14.49
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, fut.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιοῦμαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Morb.Sacr.</u>
				</span></i>
			I: aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ηγνισάμην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Alc.</u>
					1146
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, fut.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-αγνισθήσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Nu.</u>
					19.19
				</span></i>
			: aor.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ηγνίσθην</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				19.12
			</span></i>:—<i>purify, consecrate,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χθόνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
				</span></i>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gött.Nachr.</u>
				1922.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				2.31.8
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρκαϊὴν χρὴ ἀφαγνίσαι . . οἴνῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
					1034.28
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Thrace</span>):—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς νερτέροις θεοῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Alc.</u>
					1146
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
